[[Angorodon]]s are dangerous saurians from the [[Tarnished Coast]] that are usually found in groups. Their use of [[life stealing]] and other [[armor-ignoring]] [[AoE]] damage makes them quite deadly especially if they choose to focus on one party member.

Interrupting their key skills, denying the [[corpse]]s to prevent the use of [[Putrid Explosion]] or using [["Can't Touch This!"]] to prevent touch skills such as [[Twisting Jaws]] is advised.

